A diet that excludes red meat but includes poultry, fish, and dairy\nB. A diet that excludes all meat but includes eggs and dairy\nC. A diet that excludes all animal products, including meat, dairy, eggs, and honey\nD. A diet that includes only raw fruits and vegetables","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"KNOWLEDGE","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u201cWhich of the following best describes a vegan diet?\u201d Options: A. A diet that excludes red meat b...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID53"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID54","SecondaryAttribute":"Your YouTube history contains the videos you have watched and the searches you have made on the p...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Your YouTube history contains the videos you have watched and the searches you have made on the platform, see below.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<img alt=\"Access Watch History on YouTube website\" src=\"https:\/\/media.idownloadblog.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Access-Watch-History-on-YouTube-website.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%\" \/>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"TEXT_02","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Your YouTube history contains the videos you have watched and the searches you have made on the p...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID54"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID55","SecondaryAttribute":"In this study, we ask you to donate your YouTube history for research purposes. We ask you to fol...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In this study, we ask you to donate your YouTube history for research purposes. <br><br>We ask you to follow the instructions below to make a request for Google to provide you with your data now. <br><br>In a day or two, we will contact you with the next steps.<br><br>1. Go to&nbsp;https:\/\/takeout.google.com\/settings\/takeout<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q55","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this study, we ask you to donate your YouTube history for research purposes. We ask you to fol...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID55"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID56","SecondaryAttribute":"Would you be willing to donate your YouTube history as part of a research experiment? This means...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Would you be willing to donate your YouTube history as part of a research experiment? <br><br>This means you would extract all videos you have watched in the past and send them for research purposes. The exact details on how your data will be used will be discussed later on, but here we want to know if you are open to this possibility.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"C6","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"yesNo","Type":"likert","Reverse":true}}},"QuestionDescription":"Would you be willing to donate your YouTube history as part of a research experiment? This means...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID56"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID57","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.\u00a0 Part #1 (this survey; ~10 minutes): You wil..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #1 <\/strong>(this survey; ~10 minutes):\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #2 <\/strong>(in two to three days; ~30 minutes):\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will donate&nbsp;your YouTube history for research.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will watch a couple of YouTube videos.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will be asked to delete your YouTube history.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #3&nbsp;<\/strong>(in a month; ~10 minutes)\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will again be asked to donate your YouTube history.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n<\/ol><div><br><\/div><div>Upon completing the experiment, we will reward you with an additional $40. Would you be willing to participate?&nbsp;<\/div><div><\/div>&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q57","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.\u00a0 Part #1 (this survey; ~10 minutes): You wil...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID57"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID58","SecondaryAttribute":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.\u00a0 Part #1 (this survey; ~10 minutes): You wil..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #1 <\/strong>(this survey; ~10 minutes):\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will request your YouTube history to Google.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #2 <\/strong>(in two to three days; ~30 minutes):\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will donate&nbsp;your YouTube history for research.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will watch a couple of YouTube videos.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will be asked to delete your YouTube history.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<br>\n<strong>Part #3&nbsp;<\/strong>(in a month; ~10 minutes)\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>You will again be asked to donate your YouTube history.<\/li>\n\t<li>You will answer a questionnaire.<\/li>\n<\/ol><div><br><\/div><div>Upon completing the experiment, we will reward you with an additional $40. Would you be willing to participate?&nbsp;<\/div><div><\/div>&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"C7","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"yesNo","Type":"likert","Reverse":true}}},"QuestionDescription":"This survey is the first step in a three-part study.\u00a0 Part #1 (this survey; ~10 minutes): You wil...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID58"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID59","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q59","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionID":"QID59"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID6","SecondaryAttribute":"I avoid interacting with vegans whenever possible.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"I avoid interacting with vegans whenever possible.","DataExportTag":"ATVS03","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"agreeDisagree","Type":"likert","Reverse":false}},"LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"I avoid interacting with vegans whenever possible.","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly disagree"},"2":{"Display":"Somewhat disagree"},"3":{"Display":"Neither agree nor disagree"},"4":{"Display":"Somewhat agree"},"5":{"Display":"Strongly agree"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID6"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"Before you proceed, ensure you are logged in to YouTube with the same account for which you reque...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Before you proceed, ensure you are logged in to YouTube <b>with the same account for which you requested your YouTube history<\/b>. To do so:<\/p>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>In the same browser you are viewing this survey, open a new tab.<\/li>\n\t<li>Go to <a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/history\">https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/history<\/a> and check if you can view your watch history (the videos you have previously watched).<\/li>\n\t<li>If you can see your history, you are logged in. Otherwise, log in to your YouTube account and repeat Step #2.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n<p>Please only proceed if you have logged in!<br>\n<br>\nExample of what a history looks like:<br>\n<br>\n\t\n<img style=\"width: 100%\" src=\"https:\/\/princetonsurvey.az1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_6QN6IDtejDtu6ns\" alt=\"Access Watch History on YouTube website\">\n<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Note that this is the data you will be donating. If you are uncomfortable donating this data, you can always stop this study now.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Do you want to continue with the study and donate your data?<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"CONTINUE_STUDY","QuestionID":"QID60","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"yesNo","Type":"likert","Reverse":true}}},"QuestionDescription":"Before you proceed, ensure you are logged in to YouTube with the same account for which you reque...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID61","SecondaryAttribute":"Please watch the following video: video link","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please watch the following video: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/shorts\/GZVntiYzvL0\" rel=\"noopener\">video link<\/a>\n\n\n<iframe src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/shorts\/GZVntiYzvL0\" width=\"90%\" height=\"500\"><\/iframe>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q61","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please watch the following video: video link","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID61"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID62","SecondaryAttribute":"We now ask that you delete your YouTube history. Please go to\u00a0https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/histor..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"We now ask that you delete your YouTube history.\n<br>\n<br>\nPlease go to&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/history\">https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/history<\/a>&nbsp;and click on \"Clear all watch history,\" as indicated below. You will be asked to (1) confirm your action in this page and (2) upload a screenshot of your history page (similar to the screenshot below) after you have clicked  \"Clear all watch history\" and deleted your history in the next page.<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https:\/\/princetonsurvey.az1.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_dmwOwEGUHolj5gq\" style=\"width: 100%\">\n<br>\n<br><br><br>Have you deleted your history as instructed?<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"DELETE_CONTROL","QuestionID":"QID62","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"We now ask that you delete your YouTube history. Please go to\u00a0https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/histor...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"CustomValidation","CustomValidation":{"Logic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID62\/SelectableChoice\/1","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">We now ask that you delete your YouTube history.\n\n\nPlease go to&amp;nbsp;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/feed\/history&amp;nbsp;and click on \"Clear all watch history,\" as indicated below. You will be asked to confi...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">Yes<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID62\/SelectableChoice\/1","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"Selected","QuestionID":"QID62","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID62","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression"},"Message":{"description":"Incorrect response","libraryID":"UR_9Emt8LmPnWfvhGe","messageID":"MS_SEN26A6v2JdHtvl","subMessageID":"VE_CUSTOM_VALIDATION_0"}}}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID63","SecondaryAttribute":"Please watch the following video:\u00a0video link.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Please watch the following video:&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/shorts\/PPxRI79oqFs\">video link<\/a>.<br>\n<br>\n<iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" style=\"width:100%; height:800px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/PPxRI79oqFs\"><\/iframe>\n<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q63","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Please watch the following video:\u00a0video link.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID63"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_3lRgVrJmcHT6Bh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID64","SecondaryAttribute":"Knowledge Question:\u00a0A split screen was used at some points in the video.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Knowledge Question<\/b>:&nbsp;A split screen was used at some points in the video.","DataExportTag":"Q64","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"K